extends layouts/layout.pug

block content

    section.page-hero
        .public-container
            span.eyebrow
                | Frequently Asked Questions
            h1
                | Questions about NDUKA?
            p
                | Find answers to common questions about our investigation
                | services, requests, payment, reports, privacy, and communication.


    section.faq-section
        .public-container

            .faq-group
                .section-heading
                    span.eyebrow
                        | About NDUKA
                    h2
                        | Understanding NDUKA.

                .faq-list

                    details.faq-item
                        summary
                            | What is NDUKA?
                        .faq-answer
                            p
                                | NDUKA provides marriage intelligence and
                                | verification services designed to help
                                | individuals obtain relevant information before
                                | making important relationship decisions.

                    details.faq-item
                        summary
                            | What does an NDUKA investigation involve?
                        .faq-answer
                            p
                                | An investigation involves reviewing the
                                | information and investigation services selected
                                | in your request and carrying out the applicable
                                | verification work through the NDUKA
                                | investigation process.

                    details.faq-item
                        summary
                            | Who can request an investigation?
                        .faq-answer
                            p
                                | Individuals who require an NDUKA investigation
                                | service may submit a request. The request will
                                | be reviewed before it is accepted for
                                | investigation.


            .faq-group
                .section-heading
                    span.eyebrow
                        | Investigation Requests
                    h2
                        | Starting and managing a request.

                .faq-list

                    details.faq-item
                        summary
                            | What information do I need to provide?
                        .faq-answer
                            p
                                | You will be asked to provide information about
                                | yourself, the subject of the investigation,
                                | the purpose of the request, and the particular
                                | investigation services you select. Some services
                                | may require additional service-specific
                                | particulars.

                    details.faq-item
                        summary
                            | Can I request more than one investigation service?
                        .faq-answer
                            p
                                | Yes. You can select multiple active investigation
                                | services when submitting your request. The
                                | applicable services and their current prices
                                | will be reflected in the request process.

                    details.faq-item
                        summary
                            | What happens after I submit my request?
                        .faq-answer
                            p
                                | Your request is assigned a request reference
                                | and reviewed by NDUKA. You will be able to use
                                | your request reference to check the status of
                                | your request.


            .faq-group
                .section-heading
                    span.eyebrow
                        | Payment
                    h2
                        | Understanding the current payment process.

                .faq-list

                    details.faq-item
                        summary
                            | How much does an investigation service cost?
                        .faq-answer
                            p
                                | The price displayed for each active
                                | investigation service comes from the current
                                | NDUKA investigation service catalogue. If you
                                | select multiple services, the applicable
                                | service prices are combined for the request.

                    details.faq-item
                        summary
                            | Is NDUKA currently using a live online payment gateway?
                        .faq-answer
                            p
                                | No. The current NDUKA payment workflow records
                                | payment preparation and payment intent within
                                | the system. It is not a live external payment
                                | gateway.

                    details.faq-item
                        summary
                            | What happens when payment is ready?
                        .faq-answer
                            p
                                | After an accepted request has been prepared
                                | for payment, NDUKA can notify you that the
                                | payment stage is ready. The applicable payment
                                | status is also reflected in the request
                                | workflow.


            .faq-group
                .section-heading
                    span.eyebrow
                        | Reports & Status
                    h2
                        | Following your investigation.

                .faq-list

                    details.faq-item
                        summary
                            | How can I check the status of my request?
                        .faq-answer
                            p
                                | Use the Check Status option on the NDUKA public
                                | website and provide your investigation request
                                | reference to view the available status
                                | information.

                    details.faq-item
                        summary
                            | How will I know whether my request was accepted or rejected?
                        .faq-answer
                            p
                                | NDUKA can communicate important request updates
                                | through the contact details provided with your
                                | request. This includes acceptance or rejection
                                | of the request.

                    details.faq-item
                        summary
                            | Can I access an approved investigation report?
                        .faq-answer
                            p
                                | Where a client account has been created and
                                | an investigation report has been approved,
                                | the approved report can be made available
                                | through the client area.


            .faq-group
                .section-heading
                    span.eyebrow
                        | Privacy & Communication
                    h2
                        | Information and communication.

                .faq-list

                    details.faq-item
                        summary
                            | How will NDUKA communicate with me?
                        .faq-answer
                            p
                                | NDUKA can use the email address and phone number
                                | provided with your investigation request to
                                | communicate important updates, including
                                | request acceptance, rejection, and payment
                                | preparation. Where applicable, client account
                                | activation information may also be sent.

                    details.faq-item
                        summary
                            | Should I send sensitive information through a general enquiry?
                        .faq-answer
                            p
                                | Please avoid sending sensitive personal
                                | information through a general enquiry unless
                                | it is specifically requested. Use the formal
                                | investigation request process when submitting
                                | particulars required for an investigation.

                    details.faq-item
                        summary
                            | How can I contact NDUKA?
                        .faq-answer
                            p
                                | You can contact NDUKA by phone on
                                | 07076451442 or by email at
                                a(href="mailto:ndukaverify@gmail.com")
                                    | ndukaverify@gmail.com


    section.cta-section
        .public-container
            .cta-content
                div
                    span.eyebrow
                        | NDUKA
                    h2
                        | Ready to begin an investigation?
                    p
                        | Review the available services and submit your request
                        | when you are ready.

                div
                    a.btn.btn-primary(
                        href="/start-investigation"
                    )
                        | Start an Investigation
